  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">You are an Inuki loupain, with fox-like features that range from a more angular look to a square-like jowls, and an assortment of white and reddish fur. The ancient history that infuses your lineage manifests in a flicker of fortune or misfortune. You become Trained in Occultism and can Sure Strike spell once per day as an innate Occult spell. You can detect when a fortune or misfortune effect occurs within 30 feet of you, but you have no way of telling which is which. Once per day as a reaction when you notice this effect, you can impart a misfortune or a fortune effect to cancel it out. This is either a fortune effect or a misfortune effect.</span></p>"
